---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import consultingPhoto from '../assets/consulting/aaron-consulting.png';
import PullQuote from '../components/PullQuote.astro';
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
	title="Consulting and advisory · Aaron Amerling"
	description="Fractional and advisory work for founders and growth-stage teams. Marketing strategy and systems first, then AI and automation layered on top."
>
	<div class="wrap section-lg hero-grid">
		<div class="hero-copy">
			<p class="eyebrow reveal">Advisory and fractional</p>
			<h1 class="reveal">Build the marketing before you automate it.</h1>
			<p class="reveal">
				Most AI marketing programs fail for a boring reason. They automate a funnel that was already
				broken, and now it is broken faster and at greater volume. The strategy and the system have to
				be right first. Then the automation is worth wiring together.
			</p>
		</div>
		<div class="hero-photo" data-parallax="0.06">
			<Image class="reveal" src={consultingPhoto} alt="Aaron Amerling" width={340} height={340} />
		</div>
	</div>

	<div class="wrap prose">
		<h2 class="reveal">What I work on</h2>
		<ul class="reveal">
			<li>Full-funnel marketing strategy</li>
			<li>Go-to-market, brand and positioning</li>
			<li>
				Answer engine and generative engine optimization, getting cited inside AI answers, not just
				ranked in a list. I built this as a working channel before the category had a name.
			</li>
			<li>Marketing systems and automation architecture, full-funnel pipelines built hands-on, not briefed out.</li>
			<li>Marketing organization design, structure, specialist career paths, insource vs. outsource decisions.</li>
		</ul>

		<h2 class="reveal">How it works</h2>
		<p class="reveal">
			A conversation first, free. Twenty minutes. If AI or automation is not the thing that will
			move your numbers, I will say so.
		</p>
		<p class="reveal">
			From there, we figure out together what should happen next.
		</p>
		<p class="reveal">I take a small number of engagements at a time.</p>

		<PullQuote quote="My go-to innovator of marketing strategy." name="Sarah Rowlett" roleAtTime="Senior Account Director, TrendSource · Sarah was Aaron's client" current="Account Director (ex-Google)" />
		<PullQuote quote="An incredibly strategic thinker." name="Jeffrey Tompkins" roleAtTime="Director of Operations, Jacob Tyler Brand + Digital Agency · Aaron was his client" />
		<PullQuote quote="He brings a direct, no-BS mindset to every conversation, challenges conventional thinking, and often sees opportunities others miss." name="Arman Assadi" roleAtTime="Founder & CEO, Steno.ai · Arman was Aaron's client" />

		<h2 class="reveal">Who this is for</h2>
		<p class="reveal">
			Founders, growth-stage teams, startups, or any company with a marketing or product problem
			they can't seem to crack.
		</p>

		<a class="btn btn-accent reveal" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}contact/?reason=consulting`}>
			Contact me
		</a>
	</div>
</PageLayout>

<style>
	.hero-grid {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 3.5em;
	}
	.hero-copy {
		flex: 1.4;
	}
	.hero-photo {
		flex: 1;
		display: flex;
		justify-content: center;
	}
	.hero-photo :global(img) {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 340px;
		aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
		object-fit: cover;
		border: 1px solid var(--rule);
	}
	@media (max-width: 820px) {
		.hero-grid {
			flex-direction: column-reverse;
		}
		.hero-photo :global(img) {
			max-width: 220px;
		}
	}
</style>
